    {
      "name": "nontemporal-store-write-once-output",
      "description": "Non-temporal '.cs' cache_modifier on write-once output stores lifts store bandwidth on gfx950 store-bound kernels; a cache-policy win, not vectorization",
      "keywords": [
        "cache-modifier",
        "non-temporal-store",
